From e634300edcd41e8b78b89dc46539d26a9e7aa6a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:14:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [ASTER] Coordinate environment policy and
 managed features

Add the platform integrity service and client API for identity-bound collector
reports, notification continuity, mode evaluation, retained alarms and execution
receipts. Freeze authorization during the bounded shutdown handoff.

Gate TEE property views, FAS and Lineage app visibility through the existing
feature paths. Refresh package-query caches when a visibility lease expires so
cached results follow the effective permission.

Expose bounded syscall rechecks and KernelSU source verification through the
ASTER client. Consume instance-bound effective classifications while preserving
raw evidence, unresolved history and each mode's feature conditions.

Include service-level tests for report validation, notification lifecycle,
renewal and shutdown behavior.

Change-Id: Ife56f19b46a6a228cdf9f409837f6a5989404426
